        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ವಿಫಲವಾಗು",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ವಿಫಲವಾಗು — viphalavāgu — \"to fall through; to fail\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಮಳೆ ಬಂದಿದ್ದರಿಂದ ನಮ್ಮ ಯೋಜನೆ ವಿಫಲವಾಯಿತು. maḷe bandiddarinda namma yōjane viphalavāyitu. Because it rained, our plan failed."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (it …): ವಿಫಲವಾಯಿತು, viphalavāyitu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ವಿಫಲ, fruitless; ವಿಫಲತೆ, failure."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ವಿಫಲವಾಗು (viphalavāgu) is built from Sanskrit viphala, \"fruitless, vain\" (CDIAL 11803), with native āgu, \"to become\" (DEDR 333)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for saying what happens if."
            }
          ]
        },
