              "instruction": "maḷe bandiddarinda namma yōjane viphalavāyitu. — Because it rained, our plan failed.",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *maḷe bandiddarinda namma yōjane viphalavāyitu.* — Because it rained, our plan failed.]"
