            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಅವಳ ಪ್ರಯತ್ನ ಕೊನೆಗೆ ಫಲಿಸಿತು. avaḷa prayatna konege phalisitu. Her effort finally paid off."
            },
